        "collapsible_tab_qdLD7e": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Conditions",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>At Kidsy, we sell open-box, overstock, and returned items — always inspected, never guesswork. Here’s how we label condition so you know exactly what you’re getting:<br/><br/><strong>Open Box/New Overstock:<br/></strong>Item is new and unused. Box was opened due to return. Packaging/box is imperfect.<br/><br/><strong>Floor Model:<br/></strong>Fully functional item with possible minor cosmetic wear from handling. Original packaging may be missing or imperfect.<br/><br/><strong>Gently Used:<br/></strong>Light wear (like minor stain / minor scuff). Fully functional and carefully inspected. Packaging/box is imperfect.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_qNW63p": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Delivery time",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>We ship anywhere in the U.S. (except HI & AK), using USPS, UPS, and FedEx.</p><p><strong>Here’s what to expect:</strong></p><ul><li>Processing time: 3–4 business days</li><li>Delivery time: 3–7 business days after shipping</li><li>You’ll receive tracking info by email once your order ships</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_3xD4qy": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warranty and returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>We accept returns within 14 days only if your item is damaged, defective, or not as described.</p><p><strong>Here’s what to know:</strong></p><ul><li>Items must be unused and returned in original condition</li><li>We don’t accept returns for buyer’s remorse or sizing issues</li><li>You must ship the item within 4 days of receiving your return label</li><li>Refunds are issued after inspection (within 7 business days)</li></ul><p><strong>Non-returnable items include:</strong></p><ul><li>Items listed as <strong>FINAL SALE</strong></li><li>Personal care products (e.g. hygiene items)</li><li>Customized or personalized items</li></ul><p><strong>To start a return:</strong></p><p>Email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@kidsy.co\" title=\"mailto:hello@kidsy.co\">hello@kidsy.co</a> with your order number or receipt.</p><p><strong>Important: </strong>Once shipped, orders cannot be canceled or rerouted. If your order hasn’t shipped yet, we may be able to cancel it — contact us ASAP.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "custom_liquid_JEJRdB": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What’s included in the box?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Every product page lists what’s included, such as the car seat shell, base, manual, or accessories. If packaging is imperfect, accessories may vary, so please check the Includes section and condition notes.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the warranty for this item?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"If the item is new or open box, the manufacturer warranty may apply when noted in the product description. For gently used or floor model items, warranty may not apply, but we test functionality before listing.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How can I check compatibility, such as a car seat with a stroller?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Compatibility information is usually listed on the product page, including brand compatibility or adapter requirements. For complete accuracy, please also check the manufacturer’s website.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What if an item has cosmetic wear or missing packaging?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Any wear is noted on the product page. Most items ship in the original box, but some floor model or gently used items may not. Check the first line of the description for packaging details.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I cancel or change my order?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Once the order has shipped, we cannot cancel or change the address. If you reject a shipment delivery without prior approval, shipping fees may be deducted from the refund.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How long will shipping take once I’ve ordered?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Orders usually ship within 3 to 4 business days. You’ll receive tracking information, and typical delivery is 3 to 7 business days within the U.S.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is your return/refund process?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Contact us to initiate a return. We’ll send a shipping label. Items must be returned within 4 days of receiving the label and in the same condition. Refunds are processed after inspection and can take up to 7 days.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does the price reflect the condition?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Condition is a key factor in pricing. The listing shows the condition, pricing tier, and corresponding discount compared to retail.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Are there any hidden fees, such as shipping or duty?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Shipping is free on U.S. orders over $75. Orders under $75 may incur a shipping fee. There are no hidden customs or duties for U.S. domestic shipments.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What should I check when the item arrives?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"On delivery, check that you received all parts and accessories listed in the product description. Inspect for damage or discrepancies, then contact us promptly if something is missing or not as described.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>"
          }
        },
