          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if an item has cosmetic wear or missing packaging?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Any wear is noted on the product page. Most items ship in the original box; some Floor Model/Gently Used items may not. Check the first line of the description for packaging details.</p>",
